{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Paris this morning, having left my things at Cousin’s house to save the trouble of unpacking in a hotel. We are still hunting for a proper furnished room, but for now, we have settled into a routine of work and brief meals. At eleven, Cousin and I shared cutlets and a bottle of wine. It was a simple repast, but the wine was good, and the conversation lively. He is eager to see my letters to the post by two, so I must finish this note quickly. The streets here are busy, but I find a certain calm in the intellectual exchange. I am well, though the heat is oppressive. I think of you and the boys often. Do keep Ludwig’s studies steady; I trust you are managing the household well in my absence. I shall write again when I have secured a more permanent lodging.\n\nYour loving,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795219219,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":194,"prompt_tokens":946,"total_tokens":1140,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-rK5C5PrgYEZeH8FosAr6LhRegCyj9CnD","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":946,"prompt_ms":915.74,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9680126849894292,"prompt_per_second":1033.0443138882217,"predicted_n":194,"predicted_ms":4552.823,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.589756476683938,"predicted_per_second":42.3912811897146}}